# ENTITY

## Proposal

### ATTRIBUTE

| name             | type                | multiplicity |
|------------------+---------------------+--------------|
| id               | entityid            | 1            |
| originalProposal | String              | 1            |
| payload          | XJson               | 1            |
| evidence         | XSemiStructuredData | 1            |
| optionalPayload  | XJson               | ?            |
| optionalEvidence | XSemiStructuredData | ?            |
| payloads         | XJson               | *            |
| evidences        | XSemiStructuredData | *            |
| name             | name                | 1            |
| quantity         | int                 | 1            |
| active           | boolean             | 1            |
| amount           | decimal             | 1            |
| summary          | ProposalSummary     | 1            |
| optionalSummary  | ProposalSummary     | ?            |
| summaries        | ProposalSummary     | *            |

# VALUE

## ProposalSummary

### ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
